{"id":"45559b2e50b02071","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization.md","title":"Primitive Recursive Reaxiomatization","display":"thm-craig-reaxiomatization — Primitive Recursive Reaxiomatization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization","aliases":["67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization"],"display":"thm-craig-reaxiomatization — Primitive Recursive Reaxiomatization","depends_on":["[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]","[[67-df-theory-closed]]","[[67-df-primitive-recursive]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":1,"source_label":"Theorem 1","source_printed_pages":10,"source_pdf_pages":21,"source_proof_status":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明","inherited_verification_status":"source-statement-checked","inherited_source_proof_status":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明","machine_verified":false,"revision_date":"2026-10-14"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-craig-reaxiomatization — Primitive Recursive Reaxiomatization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6062469a25ee5f89\" href=\"?note=6062469a25ee5f89\" title=\"67-df-theory-closed\">67-df-theory-closed</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"locally-revised-not-source-reverified"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"10"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"21"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"inherited_verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"inherited_source_proof_status","html":"陈述及下述本地推导已复核；未作机器证明"},{"key":"machine_verified","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-14"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\)</span> 是递归可枚举句子集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 为有效一阶语言；自然句法编号使连接及公式识别原始递归。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\)</span> 是一元原始递归关系类，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"55353aba49d6b3f2\" href=\"?note=55353aba49d6b3f2\" title=\"67-df-primitive-recursive\">67-df-primitive-recursive</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_g,\\mathrm{REAx}\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_g,\\mathrm{REAx}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" href=\"?note=ae4400eaf5ddc9a9\" title=\"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory\">67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cn}_L\">\\(\\mathrm{Cn}_L\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6062469a25ee5f89\" href=\"?note=6062469a25ee5f89\" title=\"67-df-theory-closed\">67-df-theory-closed</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 表示上述固定自然原始递归句法编号；句法对象与自然数编码、对象语言数词分别使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}(X)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists Y\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\quad\n\\mathrm{Code}_g(Y)\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\land\\mathrm{Cn}_L(Y)=\\mathrm{Cn}_L(X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{REAx}(X)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists Y\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\quad\n\\mathrm{Code}_g(Y)\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\land\\mathrm{Cn}_L(Y)=\\mathrm{Cn}_L(X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 1.1, p.10。非空 X 取原始递归满射 f:ℕ→X，将 f(k) 与其自身作 k 次重复合取；Y 的候选成员的合取重复次数限制检查的 k，故 Y 为 PR，并且与 X 具有相同演绎闭包。空集情形取空集。本条记录存在性，不固定某个唯一重新公理化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-theory-closed","status":"resolved","id":"6062469a25ee5f89","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-theory-closed]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"55353aba49d6b3f2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-primitive-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-primitive-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"55353aba49d6b3f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PRPred}_1$ 是一元原始递归关系类，见 [[67-df-primitive-recursive]]；$\\mathrm{Code}_g,\\mathrm{REAx}$ 见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]，$\\mathrm{Cn}_L$ 见 [[67-df-theory-closed]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory","status":"resolved","id":"ae4400eaf5ddc9a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PRPred}_1$ 是一元原始递归关系类，见 [[67-df-primitive-recursive]]；$\\mathrm{Code}_g,\\mathrm{REAx}$ 见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]，$\\mathrm{Cn}_L$ 见 [[67-df-theory-closed]]。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-theory-closed","status":"resolved","id":"6062469a25ee5f89","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PRPred}_1$ 是一元原始递归关系类，见 [[67-df-primitive-recursive]]；$\\mathrm{Code}_g,\\mathrm{REAx}$ 见 [[67-df-recursively-enumerable-theory]]，$\\mathrm{Cn}_L$ 见 [[67-df-theory-closed]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRPred}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_g,\\mathrm{REAx}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cn}_L","display":false},{"tex":"g=\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{REAx}(X)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists Y\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L\\quad\n\\mathrm{Code}_g(Y)\\in\\mathrm{PRPred}_1\\land\\mathrm{Cn}_L(Y)=\\mathrm{Cn}_L(X).","display":true}],"bytes":2018,"backlinks":[{"id":"4ff6c9f71377d6d7","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d4e4a9a8f1949a67","anchor":"ref-18","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"源书第122页的来源记录要求允许一般源语言。本条现在引用 [[67-lem-general-source-orey-hajek]]，其源语言参数取 $K$，目标为 pullback 的定理等价 PR 算术呈示，不再调用仅允许算术源语言的窄接口，也不反向引用依赖本定理的一般目标判据。pullback 的 r.e. 公理集可用 [[67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization]] 换成定理等价 PR 呈示，以应用相应形式的第6章论证；$\\mathrm{PB}$ 的定义并不被改成 PR。"},{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-106","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-craig-reaxiomatization]]"},{"id":"161ada0e6be38670","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-df-PA]]；[[../67-df-